<title>JAPAN: Kawanishi Warehouse -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawanishi Warehouse -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.14		vs	   10.70</p>
<p> Operating	  492    million	  vs	  371    million</p>
<p> Current	    415    million	  vs	  340    million</p>
<p> Net		  162    million	  vs	   90    million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.78 yen	  vs	   11.00 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawanishi Warehouse Co Ltd is a warehousing firm operating conventional and cold-storage warehouses.</p>
